{
  "slug": "claude-code-audit-stack",
  "name": "Claude Code Audit Stack",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Adversarial verification primitives: catches silent skipped restarts, probability-stacking errors in reports, and lost-PID daemon spawns on remote hosts.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 agents** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Agents** (3): `bot-deploy-verifier` (Adversarial post-deploy verifier), `claim-auditor` (Quantitative report auditor), `remote-agent-dispatcher` (Mechanical scp-and-spawn for autonomous Claude Code agents on a remote host)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-code-audit-stack@claude-community` from `LaterKidsXD/claude-code-audit-stack`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "agent": 3,
    "hook": 1
  },
